---
title: "Sunset Dhow Cruise"
description: "End your day on a traditional Zanzibar dhow cruise, watching the sun set over the Indian Ocean with drinks and fresh fruit on board."
permalink: "/tours/sunset-dhow-cruise/"
tour_slug: "sunset-dhow-cruise"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dct-palm) 0%, var(--dct-ocean) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-marine">Marine Excursion</span>
      <h1>Sunset dhow cruise</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">2–3 hours · Nungwi, Kendwa or Stone Town</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "sunset-dhow-cruise" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-sns-booking-open data-service-slug="{{ tour_slug }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Check price &amp; book</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "tour-booking-panel.njk" %}

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>End your day with a traditional dhow sailing cruise along Zanzibar's coastline. Watch the sun dip into the Indian Ocean, sip refreshing drinks, and enjoy fresh fruit on deck as the sky turns gold and purple.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>2–3 hour sunset cruise on a traditional wooden dhow</li>
      <li>Departure from Nungwi, Kendwa, or Stone Town (your choice)</li>
      <li>Soft drinks, fresh fruit, and light snacks on board</li>
      <li>Life jackets provided; safety briefing included</li>
      <li>Photography-friendly — golden hour lighting</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Tour Highlights in Pictures</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'dhow-boats-sunset-beach-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'dhow-boats-sunset-beach-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Traditional Dhow Fleet</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'sunset-boats-palm-trees-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'sunset-boats-palm-trees-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Coastline Golden Hour</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'dhow-sail-sunset-zanzibar-water.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'dhow-sail-sunset-zanzibar-water.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Open Ocean Sunset</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 2–3 hours (1 hour before sunset to 30 minutes after)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Nungwi Beach, Kendwa Beach, or Stone Town waterfront — choose at booking</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Weather dependent — trips may be rescheduled if seas are rough</li>
      <li>Bring a light jacket; evenings can get cool on the water</li>
      <li>Perfect as a romantic experience or group activity</li>
      <li>Private charters available at higher end of price range</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Dhow, drinks/fruit varies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}
      {% include "reviews-list.njk" %}
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>📍 Tour Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">2–3 hours (1 hour before sunset to 30 minutes after)</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Nungwi, Kendwa or Stone Town</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ 'MAR' | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified published rate • 20% deposit locks private dhow &amp; refreshments • 100% Weather Guarantee</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
